<title>SOUTH AFRICA: WIT GM RAISES HALF YR SHR, NO DIV.</title>
<headline>WIT GM RAISES HALF YR SHR, NO DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December</p>
<p>31, 1996 </p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)	 </p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     6.7	   vs 1.8</p>
<p>    After tax		 0.65	  vs 0.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.99	  vs 0.33</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.33	  vs 0.16</p>
<p>    Operating profit	0.87	  vs 0.29</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1.95	  vs 1.51</p>
<p>Full name: Witwatersrand Gold Mining Co Ltd </p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said investigations were proceeding</p>
<p>regarding the exploitation value of some surface and underground</p>
<p>mining assets, with the possible disposal thereof to interested</p>
<p>parties. </p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
